<title>USA: Bed Bath says co-CEOs sell 2 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Bed Bath says co-CEOs sell 2 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>UNION, N.J. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bed Bath &amp; Beyond Inc said Thursday that Warren Eisenberg and Leonard Feinstein, co-chief executive officers, sold a total of two million shares of the company's common stock pursuant to Rule 144 under the Securities Act.</p>
<p>After giving effect to the sale, Eisenberg and Feinstein own approximately 23 percent of its common stock, the company said.</p>
</text>
